<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph>
B1093-15: Side Impact Sensor Circuit Open (Driver Side)
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
<emph>
8-channel air bag system:
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Driver front side-impact G sensor circuit has been shorted to power supply or opened.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
<emph>
10-channel air bag system:
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Driver front side-impact pressure sensor circuit has been shorted to power supply or opened.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph>
B1093-87: Side Impact Sensor Communication Data Invalid (Driver Side)
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
<emph>
8-channel air bag system:
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Driver front side-impact G sensor has communicated with invalid data.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
<emph>
10-channel air bag system:
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Driver front side-impact pressure sensor has communicated with invalid data.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph>
B1094-14: Side Impact Sensor Circuit Shorted to Ground (Passenger Side)
